   NFA Contexts: 4 peak, 7 total, 0 pruned
   NFA: 2 matched (len 1/1/1.0), 1 mismatched (len 6/6/6.0)
   NFA: 3 absorbed (len 1/1/1.0), 0 skipped
   ->  Sort (actual rows=6.00 loops=1)
         Sort Key: "*VALUES*".column1
         Sort Method: quicksort  Memory: NkB
         ->  Values Scan on "*VALUES*" (actual rows=6.00 loops=1)
